 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "races is a non-empty list of non-empty races; each race lists distinct rider names in finishing order. In each race the rider in 1st place earns 15 points, 2nd 10, 3rd 5, and every later place 0. A rider's total is the sum over all races; every rider named in any race takes part in the standings, even with 0 points. Names compare by plain character code order. Variant 1: return the rider with the highest total; on a tie return the smallest name.",
